Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 15:30:44 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 18/20] m3: apply layer UV offset, angle and tiling

Per layer a 2x3 matrix from the animated uvOffset, uvAngle and uvTiling, uploaded as LayerSettings.uvRow0/uvRow1 and applied in getUV. Rule from WhiteoutFlakes M3ComposeUvTransform (citing the SC2 client): uv' = 0.5 + S * R(angle.z) * (uv - 0.5 - offset). An undriven tiling of 0 reads as 1. The normal map now samples through getUV as well.
